The below create a problem for us:

* {{Any history of complaints against driver Abdul Rehman Idrees}}
* {{Any complaint history on the car, EE40889}}
* {{Any history of complaints against the owner of the car, Mohammad Aslam, tel. 93009134}}

For these points, we can advise the police of the existence of complaints, however we cannot provide the details of the Rider without the Rider’s prior consent. We would need the consent of the Rider before we can share their details with the police. We can also only provide the statements of the Rider on the complaint once we have their consent.

