[~accountid:641d5e830e6828ab20269e6d] *here is my vision of the letter. In all honesty, our* [*LIA*|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Le96KYN1ZOwF9xOWrysYncRS4ywlC4k8/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=106326439712206242177&rtpof=true&sd=true] *is pretty basic as the draft is basic, so this is the most I could add following the LIA and not completing the balancing exercise ad hoc.*

_Hello Thomas,_

_Thank you for your inquiry which was received by us on November 29, 2023._


_We appreciate your inquiry regarding our Legitimate Interest Assessment (LIA) under the GDPR. We would like to provide clarity on the nature of our legitimate interest._

_As it was highlighted earlier, our legitimate interest is centered around maintaining the growth of our company by informing existing customers through relevant advertising content about our services. This activity is exclusively related to customers who have a contractual relationship with Bolt, specifically those who are parties to an agreement formed by accepting the company's application Terms and Conditions (T&Cs)._

{color:#bf2600}_The LIA involves a careful balancing of Bolt's interests against the rights and freedoms of existing customers. The data processed for direct marketing is obtained directly from these customers, highlighting a transparent and direct nature in the relationship. Such communications are tailored to enhance the customers' experience, keeping them informed about relevant offers and updates, aligning with Bolt's previously described interests._{color}

{color:#bf2600}_To set an expectation among customers regarding the receipt of communications about Bolt's products or services, transparency is maintained through privacy policies and disclaimers provided before the completion of signup. These documents explicitly outline Bolt's opt-out based direct marketing activities._{color}

{color:#bf2600}_Bolt is acutely aware of the potential impact on the rights of existing customers. Therefore, in its direct marketing activities, Bolt designs its approach to be as unobtrusive as possible while respecting the preferences of these customers. Specifically, existing customers have the ability to control or object to the processing of their data at any time, both in the communication preferences and upon receiving each direct marketing message, ensuring the unsubscribe process is straightforward and accessible._{color}

_It is essential to note that the legitimacy of this interest is supported by Article 13(2) of the ePrivacy Directive. According to this directive, we may utilize electronic contact details for direct marketing of our own similar products or services._{color:#bf2600} _This is in line with the GDPR`s Recital 47, which specifically mentions that processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes may be regarded as carried out for a legitimate interest._{color}

_Sincerely,_
_Bolt_

