What do these tasks actually do?

E-mail tasks => the external id is used to obtain the url of the invoice, which is sent via email.
weekly invoice tasks => if we are within 3h of the timespan jetbrains://web-storm/navigate/reference?project=server&path=src/delivery/commerce/delivery_invoicing/main/handler/service/invoicingStrategy/BaseAggregatedInvoicingStrategy.ts —> *this will have to be adjusted*) then the invoice is ignored. Otherwise we get the records based ontthe external id. The record_rows are transformed to become invoice rows within the generated report.
UDS weekly invoice tasks => invoice external id is gotten from the payload. Records are determined based on the external id and exported as part of the invoice. Timespan is used to determine the title in case of adjustment (detecting whether the adjustment is from a previous invoice period or not).  *this will also have to be adjusted*

